WEBVTT

00:01:59.676 --> 00:02:02.316
or restrict it to those
who seek genetic counseling,

00:02:02.316 --> 00:02:04.956
are beyond reproductive age
or are sterile.

00:02:04.996 --> 00:02:08.476
It's estimated that less than one percent
of American couples are cousins.

00:02:08.516 --> 00:02:11.596
But the widespread illegality,
not to mention the social stigma,

00:02:11.636 --> 00:02:13.796
makes quantifying it quite difficult.

00:02:13.836 --> 00:02:16.196
If you ask people
why cousin marriage seems wrong,

00:02:16.196 --> 00:02:17.356
health might come up.

00:02:17.396 --> 00:02:19.596
The fear of birth defects
and genetic disorders

00:02:19.636 --> 00:02:21.636
has influenced the change in social norms.

00:02:21.676 --> 00:02:23.116
But in 2002,

00:02:23.156 --> 00:02:26.236
researchers from the National Society
of Genetic Counselors found

00:02:26.236 --> 00:02:28.716
that the increased risk was a minor one.

00:02:28.716 --> 00:02:30.316
In the general population,